"                                a dropdown; their <strong>Coefficient</strong>\n"
"                                fields look up the matching value from the\n"
"                                standard confidence table automatically."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_sample_determination
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_sample_determination.general_audit_ws_a916660_view_form
msgid ""
"<strong>Choosing samples for Non-Statistical\n"
"                            Sampling:</strong>"
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_sample_determination
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_sample_determination.general_audit_ws_a916660_view_form
msgid ""
"<strong>Confidence Factor</strong> (in\n"
"                                Parameters) is also a manual input -- it\n"
"                                is not looked up from any table, unlike\n"
"                                Classical Variable / Non-Statistical\n"
"                                Sampling's ARIA/ARIR."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_sample_determination
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_sample_determination.general_audit_ws_a916660_view_form
msgid ""
"<strong>Estimate Misstatement</strong>\n"
"                                = Tolerable Misstatement x <strong>Estimate Misstatement Ratio</strong>, and\n"
"                                <strong>Standard Deviation Estimate</strong>\n"
"                                = Estimate Misstatement x <strong>Standard Deviation Ratio</strong> (both\n"
"                                ratios are manual inputs in Parameters,\n"
"                                defaulting to 0.55 and 0.013)."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_sample_determination
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_sample_determination.general_audit_ws_a916660_view_form
msgid ""
"<strong>Final Sample Size\n"
"                                (Judgment)</strong> (Parameters) lets you\n"
"                                override the computed pool size with your\n"
"                                own figure -- leave it empty to use the\n"
"                                formula as-is."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_sample_determination
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_sample_determination.general_audit_ws_a916660_view_form
msgid ""
"<strong>How Input Variabel and Parameters feed\n"
"                            the Monetary Unit Sampling formula:</strong>"
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_sample_determination
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_sample_determination.general_audit_ws_a916660_view_form
msgid ""
"<strong>How Input Variabel and Parameters feed\n"
"                            the sample size formula:</strong>"
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_sample_determination
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_sample_determination.general_audit_ws_a916660_view_form
msgid ""
"<strong>Multiplier Random</strong> is a\n"
"                                manual input: the upper bound for\n"
"                                <strong>Random</strong>, which is redrawn\n"
"                                every time you click \"Generate Sampling\"\n"
"                                and used as the walk's starting point --\n"
"                                see Random's own help text for how it\n"
"                                interacts with Sampling Interval to pick\n"
"                                items."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_sample_determination
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_sample_determination.general_audit_ws_a916660_view_form
msgid ""
"<strong>Performance Materiality</strong>\n"
"                                and <strong>Risk Factor</strong> are manual\n"
"                                inputs (your professional judgment).\n"
"                                <strong>Tolerable Misstatement</strong>\n"
"                                auto-fills as Performance Materiality x\n"
"                                Risk Factor when either changes, but you\n"
"                                can still type over it directly."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_sample_determination
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_sample_determination.general_audit_ws_a916660_view_form
msgid ""
"<strong>Performance Materiality</strong>\n"
"                                and <strong>Risk Factor</strong> are manual\n"
"                                inputs. <strong>Tolerable\n"
"                                Misstatement</strong> auto-fills as\n"
"                                Performance Materiality x Risk Factor when\n"
"                                either changes, but can still be typed\n"
"                                over directly."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_sample_determination
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_sample_determination.general_audit_ws_a916660_view_form
msgid ""
"<strong>Sampling Interval</strong>\n"
"                                computes automatically as Tolerable\n"
"                                Misstatement / (Risk Factor / 30%) /\n"
"                                Confidence Factor -- it decides how many\n"
"                                items get selected (larger interval, fewer\n"
"                                items) and is the threshold each item's\n"
"                                cumulative amount is walked against."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_sample_determination
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_sample_determination.general_audit_ws_a916660_view_form
msgid ""
"<strong>Total Plan Examination</strong>\n"
"                                (key items + sample, on the \"Sampling\n"
"                                Data\" tab) = ROUNDUP(((Standard Deviation\n"
"                                Estimate x (ARIA Coefficient + ARIR\n"
"                                Coefficient) x Population Count) /\n"
"                                (Performance Materiality - Estimate\n"
"                                Misstatement))^2). <strong>Computed Sample\n"
"                                Size</strong> is that total minus Key Item\n"
"                                Count -- the number still to pick from the\n"
"                                pool."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_sample_determination
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_sample_determination.general_audit_ws_a916660_view_form
msgid ""
"<strong>WHERE Clause Guide (optional\n"
"                            filter):</strong>"
msgstr ""

